 ity programme: one Writer in Residence (poetry\, prose\, drama\, screen an
 d playwriting) and one Visual or New Media Artist in Residence (from paint
 ing and film to digital art\, computer graphics and interactive art).\n\nO
 rganisation: Institute for Advanced Study\, Central European University (I
 AS CEU)\nLocation: Budapest\, Hungary\nAward: Net allowance of EUR 2\,000 
 a month\, plus accommodation at the Raoul Wallenberg Guesthouse and/or off
 ice space at IAS CEU as available. Travel and health insurance are not cov
 ered.\nDuration: Up to 5 months\, minimum 3 months\; fellowships may start
